[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11641.51, "timestamp": "03:14:01", "text": "预期完全不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11643.83, "timestamp": "03:14:03", "text": "一样。我觉得 我是不是被人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11646.469, "timestamp": "03:14:06", "text": "陷害了？不，我不是说我被人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11650.389, "timestamp": "03:14:10", "text": "陷害了。更确切地说，是生活"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11658.469, "timestamp": "03:14:18", "text": "钱就像流水一样飞逝，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11662.309, "timestamp": "03:14:22", "text": "而我兼职赚的钱却很少。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11666.309, "timestamp": "03:14:26", "text": "现实正在慢慢显现，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11669.429, "timestamp": "03:14:29", "text": "我不知道该不该在直播里说这些，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11672.71, "timestamp": "03:14:32", "text": "但这里的学生，我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11676.229, "timestamp": "03:14:36", "text": "学长学姐们，他们都在做好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11679.83, "timestamp": "03:14:39", "text": "几份兼职，有些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11681.99, "timestamp": "03:14:41", "text": "兼职甚至是非法的，只能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11685.269, "timestamp": "03:14:45", "text": "拿到现金，他们就"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11687.91, "timestamp": "03:14:47", "text": "靠这种现金工作维持生计，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11692.469, "timestamp": "03:14:52", "text": "因为在这里存钱根本不可能。现在，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11694.63, "timestamp": "03:14:54", "text": "不管你挣多少钱，比如说你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11698.71, "timestamp": "03:14:58", "text": "一个月兼职挣十万或二十万，"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 11698.921, "timestamp": "03:14:58", "author": "@ToroVod", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/SJVsdKS05CPy8l97LV3ie7k3gfgzahZeoOVACjLZffjopksGckYlL3zN0Xu_2rRLA9xTaTpW2oo=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "hlooo"}]